{"id":"658382","name":"肉末煮黄粄","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658382/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄粄","amount":"200g"},{"name":"肉末","amount":"50g"},{"name":"青菜","amount":"1小把"}],"sub":[{"name":"虾皮","amount":"5g"},{"name":"小葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黄粄一小块。","img":"images/658382/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成厚片。","img":"images/658382/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备点青菜、瘦肉、小葱。","img":"images/658382/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切好，再配点虾皮。","img":"images/658382/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅烧油，放入肉末翻炒。","img":"images/658382/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒熟后放入虾皮和小葱花，继续炒出香气。","img":"images/658382/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量的清水煮开。","img":"images/658382/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入黄粄煮两分钟。","img":"images/658382/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入盐、酱油、胡椒粉调味。","img":"images/658382/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"最后倒入青菜。","img":"images/658382/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煮30秒后出锅。","img":"images/658382/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658382/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"软软糯糯，非常好吃。","img":"images/658382/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}